WEBVTT

00:11.750 --> 00:13.750
<b>Farming Life in Another World</b>

00:13.540 --> 00:21.130
<b>Masshiro hikari no naka me o samashite
hajimatteiku sutoorii</b>

00:21.130 --> 00:27.880
<b>Fumidasu atarashii sekai donna hana o sakaseyou?</b>

00:28.080 --> 00:35.460
<b>Kumori sora datte mizutamari de yogoretatte</b>

00:35.460 --> 00:38.290
<b>Bokura wa susumu</b>

00:38.290 --> 00:45.040
<b>Souzou mo shinai mirai ga matteiru kitto</b>

00:45.330 --> 00:48.920
<b>Deatte deatte tsunagatteku</b>

00:48.920 --> 00:52.210
<b>Waraeba mawari mo egao ni naru</b>

00:52.210 --> 00:56.250
<b>Chiisana tane maite sodateyou</b>

00:56.250 --> 01:00.330
<b>Yagate ookina hana ni naru</b>

01:00.330 --> 01:03.880
<b>Koukai ya shippai wa kate ni shite</b>

01:03.880 --> 01:07.170
<b>Karafuru na shiawase de afureru youni</b>

01:07.170 --> 01:11.380
<b>Bokura te o toriatte wakeatte</b>

01:11.380 --> 01:17.210
<b>Sekaijuu ni hirogatteike Flower Ring</b>

01:34.170 --> 01:38.000
<b>Spring passed us by, and the sun began
shining down stronger each day.</b>

01:38.750 --> 01:41.000
<b>The vegetables all look
so much brighter and more colorful</b>

01:41.000 --> 01:43.080
<b>after they've been sunbathing for a while.</b>

01:47.380 --> 01:48.290
<b>Hey, everyone!</b>

01:49.000 --> 01:51.630
<b>It's break time. Let's have lunch.</b>

01:51.630 --> 01:52.750
<b>Yay!</b>

01:52.750 --> 01:53.880
<b>Okay!</b>

01:54.630 --> 01:55.460
<b>Let's go!</b>

01:55.460 --> 01:56.330
<b>I'm starving!</b>

01:56.330 --> 01:57.750
<b>I'll get everything ready.</b>

01:57.750 --> 01:58.750
<b>Thanks.</b>

02:02.250 --> 02:04.500
<b>This one might grow too tall like this.</b>

02:08.250 --> 02:12.460
<b>I feel like I'm much more knowledgeable about
this stuff than when I first started farming.</b>

02:13.040 --> 02:14.710
<b>Let's see about the other plants...</b>

02:14.710 --> 02:15.880
<b>Darling!</b>

02:16.790 --> 02:17.790
<b>Huh...</b>

02:17.790 --> 02:18.750
<b>Lu?</b>

02:19.040 --> 02:21.170
<b>Come on, it's break time.</b>

02:26.540 --> 02:29.540
<b>You need to take breaks too, you know?</b>

02:30.580 --> 02:33.420
<b>When I look out at the crops,
I just can't help myself.</b>

02:40.130 --> 02:41.670
<b>Magic really is great.</b>

02:41.670 --> 02:44.130
<b>I've told you; this is basic stuff.</b>

02:45.830 --> 02:47.380
<b>I feel revitalized.</b>

02:47.380 --> 02:50.500
<b>If you work too hard,
you could collapse.</b>

02:50.500 --> 02:52.460
<b>I think I'll be fine.</b>

02:52.460 --> 02:56.210
<b>More importantly, is it okay for you
to be walking around?</b>

02:56.210 --> 02:58.170
<b>Yeah, I'm okay now.</b>

02:58.170 --> 03:01.000
<b>In fact, I've heard it's good to
get some exercise now.</b>

03:01.000 --> 03:02.540
<b>Is that right?</b>

03:02.880 --> 03:05.000
<b>Everyone's been teaching me
all kinds of stuff.
</b><b>Obviously, you can't push yourself too hard,</b><b>
</b><b>but I heard from the girls in the village</b><b></b>

03:05.000 --> 03:07.080
<b>Obviously, you can't push yourself too hard,
but I heard from the girls in the village</b>

03:07.080 --> 03:08.830
<b>Reproduction and prosperity!
</b><b>that it's important to exercise</b><b>
</b><b>to keep your body strong.</b><b></b>

03:08.830 --> 03:09.960
<b>that it's important to exercise
to keep your body strong.</b>

03:10.170 --> 03:15.500
<b>I found out that a few of the ogre maid girls
have actually given birth themselves.</b>

03:15.500 --> 03:17.000
<b>That's reassuring.</b>

03:17.000 --> 03:18.000
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:18.000 --> 03:20.710
<b>Unfortunately, I don't really know
anything about that stuff.</b>

03:22.750 --> 03:26.710
<b>It strange to think that she
has a child inside her belly.</b>

03:26.710 --> 03:28.500
<b>I wonder what that must feel like for her.</b>

03:29.540 --> 03:31.830
<b>So, what it's actually feel like?</b>

03:31.830 --> 03:34.830
<b>Now that you've gotten so big,
it's got to feel heavy.</b>

03:34.830 --> 03:38.330
<b>Yeah, I think it's about the same
as two heads of cabbage.</b>

03:38.330 --> 03:39.670
<b>That means...</b>

03:41.210 --> 03:43.330
<b>you must feel pretty heavy.</b>

03:43.330 --> 03:45.960
<b>How lovely. I'm so jealous.</b>

03:46.290 --> 03:49.330
<b>I wonder if it'll be a boy.
Or maybe a girl?</b>

03:49.330 --> 03:51.380
<b>Is there any way to know that now?</b>

03:51.380 --> 03:54.250
<b>Can we do anything to
make you more comfortable?</b>

03:54.250 --> 03:56.830
<b>Please let us know if there's
anything we can do to help.</b>

03:58.250 --> 04:00.790
<b>Everyone's being so kind and
helpful that I'm fine for now.</b>

04:00.790 --> 04:02.750
<b>My appetite is back now, too.</b>

04:02.750 --> 04:04.880
<b>The only thing bothering me is...</b>

04:06.460 --> 04:08.580
<b>that I can't drink any alcohol.</b>

04:15.790 --> 04:16.790
<b>Mayor!</b>

04:18.250 --> 04:21.750
<b>Forgive our insolence,
but we've come to make a request today.</b>

04:21.750 --> 04:23.920
<b>What is it, everyone?</b>

04:24.790 --> 04:28.630
<b>We're here to ask that Tia and
everyone else's resolution not go to waste!</b>

04:28.630 --> 04:32.250
<b>They've all become so dejected
that we can't bear to watch.</b>

04:32.830 --> 04:33.920
<b>We implore you!</b>

04:33.920 --> 04:36.670
<b>Please sell off all the alcohol in the village!</b>

04:36.670 --> 04:37.580
<b>Huh?</b>

04:37.920 --> 04:41.040
<b>I see. You're all giving up alcohol for Lu.</b>

04:41.040 --> 04:42.630
<b>That's right, however...</b>

04:42.630 --> 04:45.290
<b>When we think about
not being able to drink, we just...</b>

04:45.290 --> 04:47.290
<b>Whenever we're eating and we think</b>

04:47.290 --> 04:49.540
<b>"Man, some alcohol would
go great with this!" it feels like...</b>

04:50.830 --> 04:52.170
<b>Just like that.</b>

04:52.170 --> 04:53.540
<b>It's that bad?</b>

04:53.540 --> 04:57.290
<b>At this point I believe the only option is
to remove the source of their suffering.</b>

04:57.290 --> 04:58.500
<b>Calm down.</b>

04:58.790 --> 05:00.670
<b>I'm happy that you're all doing this,</b>

05:00.670 --> 05:03.540
<b>but I think you'll end up regretting it
if we sell all the alcohol.</b>

05:03.540 --> 05:05.830
<b>Besides, alcohol isn't something
we can quickly make again.</b>

05:07.130 --> 05:08.920
<b>Just think of it this way.</b>

05:09.330 --> 05:12.920
<b>The taste of alcohol changes
the longer you let it age after making it.</b>

05:12.920 --> 05:15.710
<b>I'm sure that if you can hold out for now,
it'll taste even better later.</b>

05:15.960 --> 05:18.540
<b>Let's all tough it out
while looking forward to that.</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:27.880
<b>Mayor, can you tell us
if we've done something wrong?</b>

05:28.790 --> 05:30.000
<b>What happened?</b>

05:30.000 --> 05:32.500
<b>Even though everyone used to
love drinking alcohol,</b>

05:32.500 --> 05:34.880
<b>none of them will drink
a single drop now.</b>

05:34.880 --> 05:35.710
<b>Ah.</b>

05:36.290 --> 05:39.250
<b>Really? So that's all it was!</b>

05:39.250 --> 05:42.250
<b>So it's not like they stopped
enjoying the alcohol we produce.</b>

05:42.250 --> 05:43.080
<b>Of course not!</b>

05:43.580 --> 05:46.460
<b>I'm sorry. We should have
let you know right away.</b>

05:46.460 --> 05:49.830
<b>I was thinking that we should
slow down production right away.</b>

05:49.830 --> 05:51.830
<b>But now I think we should do the opposite.</b>

05:51.830 --> 05:54.830
<b>Yeah. I'm sure everyone will
drink more to make up for lost time.</b>

05:54.830 --> 05:58.380
<b>Great! We'll do our best to live up to
everyone's expectations!</b>

06:18.710 --> 06:19.920
<b>Are you feeling okay?</b>

06:20.420 --> 06:21.830
<b>I'm fine.</b>

06:21.830 --> 06:24.130
<b>I'm not in here because
I'm not feeling well.</b>

06:24.130 --> 06:26.670
<b>The sun is really strong today
so I'm staying inside just to be safe.</b>

06:26.670 --> 06:28.500
<b>But it's almost time, isn't it?</b>

06:28.830 --> 06:30.540
<b>It looks that way.</b>

06:30.540 --> 06:33.960
<b>If I get any bigger than this,
I really won't be able to move at all.</b>

06:35.080 --> 06:36.380
<b>Where'd you get that?</b>

06:36.380 --> 06:39.540
<b>Tia and the angels came to visit me
and brought it with them.</b>

06:39.540 --> 06:43.460
<b>They said they found it blooming on a
far away mountain where there was still snow.</b>

06:43.460 --> 06:44.710
<b>It's really pretty.</b>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.330
<b>It kind of makes the room feel cooler.</b>

06:46.330 --> 06:49.540
<b>Believe it or not, that flower
is actually releasing cold air.</b>

06:50.830 --> 06:51.790
<b>Excuse me!</b>

06:53.040 --> 06:55.290
<b>This is a secret mountain elf medicine</b>

06:55.290 --> 06:57.540
<b>that's said to bring about
good health and vigor.</b>

06:57.540 --> 06:58.540
<b>Please take it!</b>

06:59.920 --> 07:02.040
<b>This is really valuable, isn't it?</b>

07:02.040 --> 07:04.330
<b>I'd rather it be used
when the time is right</b>

07:04.330 --> 07:07.000
<b>than have it sit around
in storage forever.</b>

07:07.000 --> 07:09.460
<b>It sounds like she's talking about
a rare item from a game.</b>

07:09.710 --> 07:10.790
<b>Hi, Lu!</b>

07:10.790 --> 07:13.380
<b>This is a gem that's supposed to help
with magic recovery!</b>

07:13.380 --> 07:15.580
<b>I found it in my father's treasure room!</b>

07:16.670 --> 07:19.460
<b>After much hard work and toiling,
it's finally complete.</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:21.080
<b>I made pudding.</b>

07:23.330 --> 07:24.210
<b>Here!</b>

07:24.210 --> 07:25.960
<b>It's a good luck charm wreath!</b>

07:26.960 --> 07:28.000
<b>Are you okay?</b>

07:28.000 --> 07:30.080
<b>Do you want me to peel apples for you?</b>

07:30.210 --> 07:32.710
<b>You must be very hungry now, right?</b>

07:32.710 --> 07:35.040
<b>I made tomato and tofu miso soup!</b>

07:35.210 --> 07:36.210
<b>Tomato?</b>

07:37.540 --> 07:38.710
<b>It's surprisingly good.</b>

07:38.710 --> 07:39.750
<b>Isn't it?!</b>

07:45.330 --> 07:47.960
<b>We're all born from eggs,</b>

07:47.960 --> 07:50.960
<b>so I have absolutely no idea
what I can do now to help out.</b>

07:50.960 --> 07:52.210
<b>But at the very least...</b>

07:52.670 --> 07:55.670
<b>I can offer you my blood to drink
so that you'll grow stronger!</b>

07:56.080 --> 07:58.710
<b>I don't think my teeth can
make it through that.</b>

08:07.540 --> 08:08.880
<b>I'm really happy.</b>

08:09.000 --> 08:10.000
<b>Me too.</b>

08:14.170 --> 08:15.460
<b>What's this?</b>

08:15.880 --> 08:17.210
<b>A wooden mallet?</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:19.080
<b>It's from Donovan.</b>

08:19.080 --> 08:21.880
<b>He said to trust him that it would
come in handy later.</b>

08:23.000 --> 08:24.460
<b>Come in handy?</b>

08:24.750 --> 08:26.960
<b>Do you need a wooden mallet for childbirth?</b>

08:27.920 --> 08:29.080
<b>What's wrong?</b>

08:34.380 --> 08:37.040
<b>My belly feels kind of...</b>

08:37.500 --> 08:38.750
<b>Does that mean...</b>

08:40.290 --> 08:41.710
<b>I think so.</b>

08:43.380 --> 08:45.000
<b>Bring the towels here.</b>

08:45.000 --> 08:46.750
<b>Boil more water.</b>

09:03.540 --> 09:07.790
<b>When the time came, I found myself
in a panic for a little while.</b>

09:09.040 --> 09:13.000
<b>But now there's nothing left
that I can do to help out.</b>

09:39.790 --> 09:41.420
<b>The two moons...</b>

09:42.330 --> 09:45.170
<b>On my first night here, I watched them
from this very same place.</b>

09:47.920 --> 09:49.790
<b>Back then I was alone.</b>

09:50.460 --> 09:53.750
<b>I wanted to live somewhere by myself,
away from anyone else.</b>

09:55.080 --> 09:56.920
<b>But now, I have everyone here.</b>

09:57.920 --> 09:59.630
<b>That's why I'm sure that...</b>

10:01.710 --> 10:04.330
<b>After that, time passed by
like a blur until morning.</b>

10:04.330 --> 10:06.380
<b>Actually, it's more accurate to say</b>

10:06.380 --> 10:08.880
<b>that I don't have any memories of
what happened after that.</b>

10:15.710 --> 10:17.130
<b>Everything went great.</b>

10:17.130 --> 10:18.960
<b>They're both doing well.</b>

10:30.000 --> 10:31.630
<b>Come hold him.</b>

10:33.750 --> 10:35.040
<b>Can I?</b>

10:36.880 --> 10:38.040
<b>Um...</b>

10:39.130 --> 10:40.460
<b>Be careful.</b>

10:40.460 --> 10:42.790
<b>He was just born. Watch his neck.</b>

10:42.790 --> 10:44.460
<b>Make sure to support it with your arm.</b>

10:44.460 --> 10:45.460
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:50.250 --> 10:52.000
<b>He's warm.</b>

10:52.000 --> 10:54.130
<b>And he's heavier than I expected.</b>

10:54.630 --> 10:56.630
<b>Even though he's so small.</b>

10:58.170 --> 10:59.380
<b>He moved!</b>

10:59.540 --> 11:00.920
<b>Of course he does.</b>

11:00.920 --> 11:03.420
<b>He was moving around a lot
when he was still in my belly.</b>

11:04.670 --> 11:06.040
<b>I see.</b>

11:08.170 --> 11:09.420
<b>He smiled!</b>

11:09.420 --> 11:10.830
<b>That was a smile, right?</b>

11:11.460 --> 11:14.040
<b>He's happy that his dad's holding him.</b>

11:20.040 --> 11:21.540
<b>That's right.</b>

11:21.540 --> 11:23.540
<b>I've really become a father.</b>

11:24.920 --> 11:28.330
<b>Back in my original world,
I was suffering from an illness.</b>

11:29.170 --> 11:31.710
<b>I hope he never has to go through that.</b>

11:32.790 --> 11:34.790
<b>Grow up to be strong for me.</b>

11:38.380 --> 11:40.750
<b>He's not going to just grow up strong,</b>

11:40.750 --> 11:42.630
<b>we're going to raise him to be strong.</b>

11:42.630 --> 11:43.790
<b>Together.</b>

11:47.210 --> 11:48.540
<b>That's right.</b>

11:52.330 --> 11:54.380
<b>What's wrong? What should I do?!</b>

11:54.380 --> 11:56.630
<b>Please calm down!</b>

11:56.630 --> 11:58.000
<b>Just relax.</b>

12:07.250 --> 12:08.500
<b>Done!</b>

12:08.500 --> 12:11.170
<b>It's been a week since Lu gave birth.</b>

12:11.710 --> 12:14.250
<b>My son's name is Alfred.</b>

12:14.250 --> 12:15.880
<b>That was Lu's idea.</b>

12:16.170 --> 12:19.920
<b>I guess his race is technically
half-vampire... maybe?</b>

12:19.920 --> 12:22.630
<b>But right now he looks like
a normal human.</b>

12:27.790 --> 12:30.250
<b>This is where I started living by myself.</b>

12:34.170 --> 12:36.250
<b>A lot more people live here now.</b>

12:37.750 --> 12:39.580
<b>There are more buildings now, too.</b>

12:39.830 --> 12:41.670
<b>Everything kept growing.</b>

12:42.500 --> 12:44.630
<b>Now it's a village where I live
together with everyone.</b>

12:45.920 --> 12:47.920
<b>Then one day, I became mayor.</b>

12:51.920 --> 12:55.420
<b>And now, I've finally become a father.</b>

12:56.710 --> 12:58.040
<b>Speaking of which...</b>

12:58.500 --> 13:01.330
<b>I need to do something to thank
all the villagers for their kindness.</b>

13:01.960 --> 13:05.580
<b>They've all been working so hard
up until now to help build up the village.</b>

13:09.250 --> 13:11.670
<b>What did you gather us
to talk about today?</b>

13:12.080 --> 13:14.130
<b>The thing is, I've been thinking about</b>

13:14.130 --> 13:16.500
<b>a new system I want to
set up for this village.</b>

13:16.500 --> 13:17.710
<b>A system?</b>

13:18.170 --> 13:19.170
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:19.920 --> 13:20.920
<b>This.</b>

13:21.540 --> 13:23.040
<b>It's a reward medal.</b>

13:23.170 --> 13:24.330
<b>A medal?</b>

13:24.580 --> 13:26.670
<b>What is it for?</b>

13:26.880 --> 13:29.250
<b>I want to give these medals out
to everyone who helped</b>

13:29.250 --> 13:31.790
<b>build up the village as thanks
for their hard work.</b>

13:33.040 --> 13:35.540
<b>How do we use them?</b>

13:35.880 --> 13:37.630
<b>You can trade them for goods you want</b>

13:37.630 --> 13:39.710
<b>or use them to get
other things you're after.</b>

13:39.710 --> 13:43.080
<b>Then they're like money, right?</b>

13:43.420 --> 13:44.630
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:44.630 --> 13:48.210
<b>I figured that one day The Great Tree Village
would need its own currency.</b>

13:48.630 --> 13:50.880
<b>Right now we have
a lot of stuff in the village.</b>

13:51.080 --> 13:54.290
<b>Crops, hunted game meat, and traded goods.</b>

13:54.920 --> 13:58.250
<b>As the mayor of the village, I've been
taking charge of all these things</b>

13:58.250 --> 14:01.080
<b>and then distributing them
to everyone myself.</b>

14:01.580 --> 14:05.750
<b>Whenever someone wants something,
they come ask me about it.</b>

14:06.250 --> 14:08.330
<b>But with the increasing
population of the village,</b>

14:08.330 --> 14:11.420
<b>handling all of these transactions on my own
has become borderline impossible.</b>

14:11.420 --> 14:12.710
<b>I see.</b>

14:13.080 --> 14:16.830
<b>If we're going to handle transactions
on our own, then we need currency.</b>

14:16.830 --> 14:17.920
<b>That's right.</b>

14:17.920 --> 14:20.500
<b>Can't we just trade goods with each other?</b>

14:20.830 --> 14:22.580
<b>Think about it this way.</b>

14:22.580 --> 14:24.880
<b>How many strawberries is
a single apple worth?</b>

14:24.880 --> 14:27.330
<b>Um, I'd say about three strawberries.</b>

14:27.330 --> 14:31.130
<b>I'd say they're one to one
since I prefer strawberries.</b>

14:31.130 --> 14:33.880
<b>Yup. Everyone places
a different value for things.</b>

14:34.130 --> 14:37.460
<b>That's why I want to use currency
for our transactions.</b>

14:37.460 --> 14:40.040
<b>So that's what money is for.</b>

14:40.330 --> 14:42.330
<b>How many barrels of gold
is an apple worth?</b>

14:42.330 --> 14:44.830
<b>I almost never use money so I'm not sure.</b>

14:45.040 --> 14:46.630
<b>You count it in barrels?</b>

14:46.630 --> 14:48.880
<b>I expect nothing less from the dragons.</b>

14:49.250 --> 14:51.920
<b>Anyways, I think it would
cause a lot of turmoil</b>

14:51.920 --> 14:53.750
<b>if I switched everything over
to currency right away.</b>

14:53.750 --> 14:56.170
<b>So for now I'm going to start by
giving these out as reward medals.</b>

14:56.170 --> 14:57.500
<b>That's the plan.</b>

14:57.670 --> 15:01.420
<b>I see. In that case,
let's try them out for a while.</b>

15:01.420 --> 15:02.420
<b>Great.</b>

15:02.420 --> 15:03.920
<b>For now, let's just think of these as</b>

15:03.920 --> 15:06.040
<b>convenient little vouchers
you exchange for things.</b>

15:07.210 --> 15:11.580
<b>And so to get things going, I started by
giving all the villagers three medals each.</b>

15:12.170 --> 15:15.080
<b>I couldn't give out medals to
all of Kuro and Zabuton's families,</b>

15:15.080 --> 15:16.580
<b>so I gave them 30 medals each.</b>

15:17.000 --> 15:21.000
<b>On top of that, I have to make them all by hand
in a way that they can't be counterfeited.</b>

15:21.000 --> 15:23.080
<b>That limits how many I can make.</b>

15:23.670 --> 15:25.420
<b>Everyone reacted differently.</b>

15:25.420 --> 15:26.670
<b>Give me wine.</b>

15:28.080 --> 15:30.500
<b>Some people traded them
for wine right away.</b>

15:31.330 --> 15:33.830
<b>Some people traded them
for furniture and the like.</b>

15:34.670 --> 15:37.880
<b>Some people traded them for weapons
that Dryme had brought us as gifts.</b>

15:39.170 --> 15:40.380
<b>And some people...</b>

15:41.000 --> 15:43.040
<b>just decorated their rooms with them.</b>

15:43.290 --> 15:46.500
<b>I'd prefer it if they didn't just
hold onto them without spending any.</b>

15:46.920 --> 15:49.330
<b>That's how I started
introducing the reward medals</b>

15:49.330 --> 15:51.330
<b>that were the precursors for currency, but...</b>

15:51.630 --> 15:53.040
<b>Let's see.</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:55.210
<b>Oh! I've got it.</b>

15:55.630 --> 15:57.880
<b>...it resulted in orders for
custom made furniture and toys</b>

15:57.880 --> 15:59.500
<b>to become incredibly popular.</b>

15:59.750 --> 16:02.540
<b>If anything, I feel like
I'm doing more work now.</b>

16:04.380 --> 16:06.540
<b>Uh, just wait a little while for me.</b>

16:06.540 --> 16:10.130
<b>In addition, I said that I wanted to use these
as a guide for how much things are worth.</b>

16:10.710 --> 16:14.420
<b>But sometimes it's hard to determine exactly
how much a single medal should be worth.</b>

16:14.960 --> 16:16.210
<b>Mayor!</b>

16:17.130 --> 16:20.250
<b>I want you to give me... a baby!</b>

16:21.540 --> 16:22.960
<b>Is that an option?!</b>

16:22.960 --> 16:23.920
<b>It's not!</b>

16:24.210 --> 16:25.920
<b>What if I give you three?</b>

16:25.920 --> 16:28.540
<b>That's not the issue here.</b>

16:31.130 --> 16:35.960
<b>In the end, we settled on them
renting out the mayor for a day instead.</b>

16:37.210 --> 16:39.170
<b>And a little while after that...</b>

16:50.630 --> 16:54.380
<b>...it was finally time for the big feast
to celebrate the birth of my son.</b>

16:56.040 --> 16:56.880
<b>Cheers!</b>

16:57.080 --> 16:58.290
<b>Cheers!</b>

17:02.960 --> 17:05.000
<b>I kind of feel bad.</b>

17:05.210 --> 17:07.040
<b>I kept them all waiting for a while.</b>

17:07.040 --> 17:09.750
<b>Yeah, we couldn't have a feast
right after you gave birth.</b>

17:10.000 --> 17:13.330
<b>Well, they all seem to be enjoying
themselves now, so I think it's okay.</b>

17:13.750 --> 17:16.750
<b>I am a little worried that they
might drink too much, though.</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:20.710
<b>Hi there! It's your big sister, Flora!</b>

17:21.250 --> 17:22.960
<b>By the way, is that...</b>

17:23.210 --> 17:24.330
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:24.330 --> 17:27.830
<b>Donovan told me to
bring it here with me today.</b>

17:29.830 --> 17:31.960
<b>Sorry we took so long.</b>

17:34.290 --> 17:35.540
<b>What's this?</b>

17:36.380 --> 17:40.250
<b>It's a special new kind of wine
that we made just for you guys.</b>

17:40.250 --> 17:43.920
<b>This is our way of celebrating with you,
so make sure you do it right!</b>

17:44.130 --> 17:45.500
<b>It's time to use it!</b>

17:45.790 --> 17:47.000
<b>You mean this?</b>

17:47.000 --> 17:49.080
<b>I see. So that's what it's for.</b>

17:52.380 --> 17:53.830
<b>Here we go!</b>

17:56.210 --> 17:58.880
<b>Congratulations, Mayor!</b>

18:02.830 --> 18:04.920
<b>That felt really good.</b>

18:04.920 --> 18:06.500
<b>Yeah, it did.</b>

18:07.000 --> 18:11.630
<b>I never thought I'd be cracking open
a barrel of wine in celebration in this world.</b>

18:11.630 --> 18:15.040
<b>I guess doing something big like this always
makes celebrations more fun, wherever you are.</b>

18:15.170 --> 18:18.040
<b>Hey everyone, drink up!</b>

18:25.290 --> 18:29.170
<b>Man, this booze is great!
The food is great! Congratulations!</b>

18:29.170 --> 18:31.130
<b>Now it's time for my secret technique!</b>

18:35.580 --> 18:37.130
<b>Is she okay?</b>

18:37.830 --> 18:40.170
<b>Well, what do you think of the wine?</b>

18:40.170 --> 18:41.290
<b>Donovan...</b>

18:41.290 --> 18:42.710
<b>The thing is...</b>

18:43.750 --> 18:46.040
<b>Ah, I get it.</b>

18:46.290 --> 18:50.210
<b>I'm sorry, but I've been told I shouldn't
drink as long as I'm breastfeeding.</b>

18:50.210 --> 18:52.710
<b>I see. You can't drink
as long as he's still a baby.</b>

18:52.710 --> 18:54.040
<b>I get it.</b>

18:54.040 --> 18:56.540
<b>Right now, I'll let them all drink for me.</b>

18:56.540 --> 19:00.330
<b>I'll enjoy the wine by watching
all their smiling faces.</b>

19:01.420 --> 19:02.750
<b>I've got an idea.</b>

19:02.750 --> 19:06.420
<b>How about before everyone drinks it all,
we bottle it so we can age the wine?</b>

19:06.420 --> 19:08.170
<b>Oh, that sounds great!</b>

19:08.170 --> 19:11.250
<b>We can hold onto it until Alfred
is old enough to drink it himself.</b>

19:11.250 --> 19:12.380
<b>Great idea!</b>

19:12.380 --> 19:13.420
<b>Alright!</b>

19:13.750 --> 19:17.460
<b>I'll make sure to keep it safe
and age it so it's the best wine ever!</b>

19:17.460 --> 19:18.790
<b>Get started on this right away!</b>

19:18.790 --> 19:20.000
<b>If we drag our feet, they'll drink it all.</b>

19:20.000 --> 19:21.210
<b>I want more!
</b><b>If we drag our feet, they'll drink it all.</b><b></b>

19:22.250 --> 19:26.080
<b>The day I can drink wine
with my son. I can't wait.</b>

19:26.380 --> 19:28.290
<b>That day will be here before you know it</b>

19:28.290 --> 19:30.830
<b>as long as you're enjoying life
every day like this.</b>

19:32.040 --> 19:33.380
<b>Look!</b>

19:33.380 --> 19:38.210
<b>Alfred loves his big sister Flora so much!</b>

19:38.460 --> 19:41.040
<b>I think he wants to be my baby!</b>

19:41.040 --> 19:42.210
<b>Stop right there.</b>

19:43.170 --> 19:45.040
<b>About The Great Tree Village...</b>

19:45.040 --> 19:46.460
<b>What is it this time?!</b>

19:46.460 --> 19:50.130
<b>They had a child.
It was a healthy baby boy.</b>

19:50.130 --> 19:51.790
<b>Oh, that's nice.</b>

19:51.790 --> 19:54.000
<b>Based on all of the information
we've heard so far,</b>

19:54.000 --> 19:58.330
<b>I think the very notion that we could
challenge them is impossible as of now.</b>

19:58.330 --> 20:00.000
<b>So you've finally realized it?</b>

20:00.000 --> 20:01.750
<b>We should be thinking about</b>

20:01.750 --> 20:04.170
<b>how we can maintain an amicable
relationship with that village.</b>

20:04.380 --> 20:07.380
<b>If we can marry off someone from the
Demonic Kingdom to their village one day,</b>

20:07.380 --> 20:09.630
<b>then it will guarantee our safety here!</b>

20:09.630 --> 20:10.830
<b>Unacceptable.</b>

20:11.040 --> 20:11.880
<b>Pardon?</b>

20:11.880 --> 20:13.460
<b>I won't hand over Yuri as a bride!</b>

20:13.460 --> 20:15.130
<b>Not to anyone ever!</b>

20:15.130 --> 20:16.960
<b>No matter what!</b>

20:16.960 --> 20:18.290
<b>Please calm down.</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:22.380
<b>Did you gather all the goods?</b>

20:22.380 --> 20:23.290
<b>Yes.</b>

20:23.580 --> 20:27.130
<b>It'll leave a poor impression if we don't
make sure to congratulate them properly.</b>

20:27.130 --> 20:29.580
<b>We must make sure
all our preparations are perfect.</b>

20:29.580 --> 20:33.130
<b>I want our relationship with that village
to continue on for a long time.</b>

20:41.710 --> 20:43.670
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

20:43.670 --> 20:45.630
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

20:46.330 --> 20:48.540
<b>I just had a dream
for the first time in a while.</b>

20:58.880 --> 21:00.170
<b>Could it be...</b>

21:00.170 --> 21:01.830
<b>that you have a hangover?</b>

21:01.830 --> 21:04.130
<b>But you didn't drink last night, either.</b>

21:04.460 --> 21:06.750
<b>No. I'm fine now.</b>

21:09.170 --> 21:11.710
<b>In that case, I want to talk about</b>

21:11.710 --> 21:14.380
<b>something that Granmaria and the others
brought up with me.</b>

21:14.960 --> 21:16.540
<b>People that want to move here?</b>

21:16.540 --> 21:17.710
<b>Yes.</b>

21:17.710 --> 21:20.460
<b>They were living in a different forest,</b>

21:20.460 --> 21:23.130
<b>and now they're looking for
somewhere new to live.</b>

21:23.130 --> 21:27.080
<b>Dryme said that he's got some people that were
driven out of their homes because of a war.</b>

21:27.080 --> 21:29.290
<b>My father also mentioned that
there are some refugees</b>

21:29.290 --> 21:31.750
<b>that need a place to stay because of
the war with Fullhardt Kingdom.</b>

21:31.750 --> 21:32.960
<b>How many are there?</b>

21:32.960 --> 21:34.210
<b>It's not an exact figure, but...</b>

21:34.210 --> 21:35.000
<b>Um, let's see...</b>

21:35.000 --> 21:36.330
<b>If I'm giving a rough estimate, it's about...</b>

21:36.330 --> 21:37.960
<b>We broke the three-digit mark.</b>

21:38.130 --> 21:42.080
<b>I think we'd need another village like this one
if we're going to take that many people.</b>

21:42.080 --> 21:43.790
<b>Then let's do it.</b>

21:44.500 --> 21:47.960
<b>Let's build a new village for the people
that want to move here.</b>

21:48.210 --> 21:49.460
<b>That sounds great!</b>

21:49.460 --> 21:51.960
<b>If we do that, then lots of people
can move here.</b>

21:51.960 --> 21:54.000
<b>So it'll be The Great Tree Village 2?</b>

21:54.000 --> 21:57.130
<b>Wait a minute, won't that be a ton of work?</b>

21:57.130 --> 21:58.750
<b>We need to prepare and gather supplies.</b>

21:58.750 --> 22:00.460
<b>We'll do our best!</b>

22:01.500 --> 22:04.210
<b>This village saved us all.</b>

22:04.210 --> 22:07.790
<b>If someone needs our help,
we can't just leave them alone.</b>

22:08.250 --> 22:11.540
<b>Still, we'll need to plan everything out
very carefully for this.</b>

22:11.540 --> 22:13.250
<b>Where should we build it?</b>

22:14.080 --> 22:16.250
<b>Alright. Let's have a meeting
about it right away.</b>

22:16.250 --> 22:18.080
<b>I'm counting on your help, everyone.</b>

22:18.080 --> 22:19.170
<b>Yeah!</b>

22:36.210 --> 22:44.920
<b>Kisetsu no kaze fuwari yubisaki de sotto kanjiru</b>

22:45.250 --> 22:53.830
<b>Sora ni ukabu kumo ni daisuki sagasou</b>

22:53.830 --> 22:58.630
<b>Tokei no hari wa ima wa wasure</b>

22:58.630 --> 23:03.040
<b>Shinkokyuu hitotsu shitemiyouyo</b>

23:03.040 --> 23:12.670
<b>Nanairo no keshiki kokoro hibiku</b>

23:14.000 --> 23:19.040
<b>Donna negai koto demo kanau ki ga suru</b>

23:19.040 --> 23:23.540
<b>Kimi ga soba ni iru nara</b>

23:23.540 --> 23:28.130
<b>Yume mitaina hibi o kuretan dayo</b>

23:28.380 --> 23:32.920
<b>Atatakakute yasashii basho de</b>

23:32.920 --> 23:40.080
<b>Itsumademo egao o miseteite</b>
